# Never copy host build artifacts into the image — the image runs `npm ci` +
# `npm run build` itself. Critically, the host's node_modules is a glibc build;
# this image is musl (alpine), so copying host node_modules over the image's
# freshly-installed musl better-sqlite3 breaks it at runtime (__memmove_chk:
# symbol not found / ERR_DLOPEN_FAILED).
node_modules
dist
.out
.superpowers
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.git
